      "message": "test(post): regenerate the goldens for the program comments\n\n26 goldens gain only the new setup/operation/tool comment lines\n(Heidenhain also renumbers its blocks around them); removing the\ncomment lines gives back each old file exactly. The legacy-stream\nconformance goldens carry no PARAMs and are unchanged.\n\nFixes #257\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
